{"title":"블루 록 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=ZounR/dJMcadIpXRf/StdZzcthTKtSYN078VO0fK&filename=th3","synopsis":"세계가 꿈이었을 텐데─!!\n에고이스트 스트라이커 300명 집결!!\n2018년 월드컵, 일본대표 16강에서 탈락….\n이를 계기로 일본 축구 연합은 월드컵 우승을 위해\n300명의 고등학생 포워드를 수용하는\n육성 기숙사 '푸른 감옥(블루 록)'을 설립.\n코치를 맡은 남자 에고 진파치는 일본에 필요한 것은\n「에고이즘이 철철 넘치는 스트라이커」라고 단언.\n무명의 포워드 이사기 요이치를 비롯하여\n모인 학생들은 자신을 에고이스트로 바꾸어\n서로를 탈락시키는 선별에 도전하다!\n\n깨져라, 일본 축구! 한 번 더 꿈을 꾸기 위해!!\n\nⓒMuneyuki Kaneshiro, Yusuke Nomura/Kodansha Ltd.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":147,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":206,"change":{"type":"down","amount":59}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":241,"change":{"type":"down","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":164,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":203,"change":{"type":"down","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":149,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":207,"change":{"type":"down","amount":58}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":251,"change":{"type":"down","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":152,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":229,"change":{"type":"down","amount":77}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":144,"change":{"type":"up","amount":85}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":225,"change":{"type":"down","amount":81}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":266,"change":{"type":"down","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":149,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":201,"change":{"type":"down","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":243,"change":{"type":"down","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-10-09","rank":158,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-10","rank":217,"change":{"type":"down","amount":59}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":152,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":156,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08